AArch64 VW+ldaddal
"Expected: Allowed in variants POPL18 and Cur (ARMBar.VW.vw_allowed; flag F1), Forbidden in CurSI (ARMBar.VW.vw_acq_si_forbidden). KEY TEST for flags F1 and F2. Source: Coq memory/ARMBar.v. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{
0:X1=s; 0:X2=z;
1:X1=s; 1:X2=z;
}
 P0                 | P1          ;
 MOV W5,#1          | LDR W0,[X2] ;
 LDADDAL W5,W6,[X1] | DMB LD      ;
 MOV W0,#1          | LDR W3,[X1] ;
 STR W0,[X2]        |             ;
exists (1:X0=1 /\ 1:X3=0)
